      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DASH INTENTION (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish a neck away in second (22.80) at Warragul in a Grade 5 over 400m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. One of the contenders. MAD HATTER ROSE (2) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 1.75 lengths second (19.99) in a Grade 5 at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. GALBA STACEY (3) has a strong overall record having 15 wins and 15 places from 40 starts but was out of the money last time when eighth (19.59) over 350m at Healesville. Expected to feature on best form. BANDIT MIA (8) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to make amends.",
